**Target:** All spokes and hub  
**Affects:** `WAI-Spoke/commands/wai.md` (or `WAI-Hub/commands/wai.md`)  
**Type:** Skill enhancement  
**Safe to auto-adopt:** true  
**Version:** 2.0  
**Created:** 2026-03-17  
**Author:** Mario Vaccari + Claude Sonnet 4.5

---

